File Index

/docker notes.md
Purpose: Docker command reference and workflow notes for project deployment and management.

/docker-compose.shattered-archive-experimental.yml
Purpose: This file defines an experimental Docker Compose setup for Shattered Archive development and testing.

/docker-compose.yml
Purpose: This file orchestrates a production deployment of a multi-service web application using Docker containers.

/game-client.Dockerfile
Purpose: This Dockerfile builds and deploys the game client application with nginx serving the compiled assets.

/game-server.Dockerfile
Purpose: This Dockerfile builds and runs the game server application in a production environment.

/index.html
Purpose: This HTML file serves as a local development setup guide for the ShatteredArchive project, instructing users on configuring domain mappings for Docker services.

/nginx.Dockerfile
Purpose: Nginx Dockerfile configuring SSL, logging, and entrypoint for edge subdomains.

/web-client.Dockerfile
Purpose: Dockerfile for building and serving the web client application with nginx.

/web-server.Dockerfile
Purpose: This Dockerfile builds and runs the web server application in a production environment.
